Reason: the Forsaken Fortress FIRST_HINT event (Tetra calling Link through the Pirate's Charm) uses the ROLLING event camera, whose rollingEvCamera was empty: it never set readiness and never finished, so Link, TAGHINT and the countdowns waited forever with the letterbox up. Reconstructed from retail 800B18E4..800B2660: Center/Eye resolved once relative to RelActor per RelUseMask (o/n/p/r), readiness set, then each frame the view center eases by CtrCus and the eye orbits it (azimuth += frame*Roll degrees, radius += frame*RadiusAdd, fixed Latitude for TransType 2, Fovy, optional Bank). No Timer completes the cut at once; with one, at frame >= Timer.

--- a/src/d/d_ev_camera.cpp
+++ b/src/d/d_ev_camera.cpp
@@ -198,8 +198,102 @@
 
